  <item>
    <title>跟着多姐解锁山西芮城</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6516c1490432a31578b96232</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6516c1490432a31578b96232</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 30 Sep 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>9月15-17日，我、阿久和我妈跟着多姐去了一趟山西芮城，本期节目是这次行程的一个回顾。因为涉及到一些地名和配图，这期破例做个timeline。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">00:01:13</a> 多姐的行程设计理念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">00:05:55</a> 本次行程红黑榜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="383">00:06:23</a> 不推荐：普救寺（图为多姐与“张生踰墙处”合影）</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..jpg!thumbnail"></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="459">00:07:39</a> 强烈推荐：广仁王庙</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..jpg!thumbnail"></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="871">00:14:31</a> 强烈推荐：永乐宫（图为永乐宫三清殿内壁画《朝元图》局部）</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..jpg!thumbnail"></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1117">00:18:37</a> 虢国博物馆（车马坑、缀玉瞑目、玉蜘蛛和玉鸮）</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..jpg!thumbnail"></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">00:23:00</a> 鹳雀楼</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..jpg!thumbnail"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1659">00:27:39</a> 西侯度（图为烧骨化石标本&amp;西侯度外景）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnfxKez4IL93maOCPW78S0b1dU-L.png"></figure><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly91cGxvYWRlci5zaGltby5pbS9mLzRZUXVGUEpkcFZqQktzQ24uanBlZyF0aHVtYm5haWw_.jpeg!thumbnail"></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1751">00:29:11</a> 芮城城隍庙</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly91cGxvYWRlci5zaGltby5pbS9mL1c3amdaWG1NTklZMUxhbGYuanBlZyF0aHVtYm5haWw_.jpeg!thumbnail"></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1962">00:32:42</a> 风陵渡&amp;推荐一个黄河观景位（图为风陵渡&amp;航拍画面截图）</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..jpg!thumbnail"></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnvW1dlmlgAY5R2cMgngcwAnpQmx.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2445">00:40:45</a> 寿圣寺舍利塔</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..jpg!thumbnail"></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2529">00:42:09</a> 偶遇一场传统婚礼</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..jpg!thumbnail"></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..jpg!thumbnail"></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2743">00:45:43</a> 一些关于租车&amp;导航不准&amp;限速30的吐槽（图为半小时只能充3度电的慢充充电桩）</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..jpg!thumbnail"></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3428">00:57:08</a> 吃喝盘点：熟肉店&amp;西厢牛肉饺子馆（图为牛肉油泼面、饼子夹肉和卤味拼盘）</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..jpg!thumbnail"></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3755">01:02:35</a> 这一趟我们花了多少钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4214">01:10:14</a> 尾声</span></p><span></span><p><span>*封面是五毛特效把我们四个p到了广仁王庙（因为全程忘了四人合照，原图是在北京西站拍的）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lg-r9FIMBqUz_A58e5ui98kITApk.m4a" length="89695290" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:15:26</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZnbUZoLU12dzBVX1pLVjN1cjJ2djNaTEhnelAucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
